WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.705
Hadley, under the mountains.

00:02.486 --> 00:06.866
The mountain behind the lander rises several kilometres above the flat ground.

00:07.390 --> 00:11.440
Turn round to find the long winding channel the astronauts drove to.

00:11.981 --> 00:14.564
The gold line is the rover's real track.
